Recommends: aegis-net
Description: Aegis OS Control Center (GTK)
 A single graphical panel to manage Aegis privacy settings: switch the network
 mode (Tor / I2P / Both / Direct), see live Tor/I2P/firewall status, spoof the
 MAC address, check for updates, and trigger an emergency RAM-wipe + power-off.
 .
 Privileged actions are run via pkexec against small audited helpers, so the GUI
 itself runs unprivileged.
